    "briefing": "Got a special assignment - Loads of packages ready to delivered across the system. Its a bit more than the usual so I'm only reaching out to my best contractors for this one.\n\nObviously, a part of that payment will be to cover your fuel because you'll be going super far with this one. You'll need all the usual as well like a handheld tractor beam and a ship with space to store [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers.\n\nGood luck. I'm counting on you.\n\n[Contractor]\n\nElla Tieno\nJr. Logistics Coordinator\nCovalex Shipping\n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.",
